A sonar ping reveals all mines in a 3x3 tile area without the danger of setting them off. It comes with a 20 second cost added to your time.	HelpWindow		Unu ping sonar iscobiat totu sas minas in un'àrea de 3x3 ragiolas chena perìgulu de las fàghere tzacare. Custu costat 20 segundos agiuntos a su tempus tuo.
Clicking with both buttons (or SHIFT + left click):	HelpWindow		Carchende cun ambos is butones (o SHIFT + incarcada a manca):
Flag a tile as a mine, set a question mark if you're unsure, or unmark an already flagged tile.	HelpWindow		Marca una ragiola comente minada, pone unu puntu de pregunta si no tenes seguresa, o boga su sinnu dae una ragiola giai marcada.
Help	HelpWindow		Agiudu
If the tile is a number and the appropriate number of mines around it have been flagged, it will clear all the other tiles around the number. Of course, if you've made a mistake, you'll probably set off a mine...	HelpWindow		Si sa ragiola tenet unu nùmeru e deghet a su nùmeru de minas marcadas a inghìriu de custa, custu at a limpiare totu is àteras ragiolas a inghìriu de su nùmeru. Est a nàrrere chi, si as faddidu, est probàbile chi as a tzacare una mina…
Left click:	HelpWindow		Carcada a manca:
Middle click (or ALT + left click):	HelpWindow		Carcada in mesu (o ALT + carcada a manca):
OK	HelpWindow		Deghet
Reveal what's under a tile. If it's a mine, the game is over!	HelpWindow		Iscobia ite b'at suta una ragiola. Si est una mina, sa partida est acabada!
Right click:	HelpWindow		Carcada a dereta:
The goal of the game is to flag all mines that are hidden on the board. The counter on the top left shows the number of still hidden mines, the one on the right counts up the seconds.	HelpWindow		Sa tarea de su giogu est ponnere banderas subra totu is minas cuadas in sa tàula. Su nùmeru a manca a susu mustrat cantu minas sunt ancora cuadas, su chi est a dereta contat is segundos
